WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.945 --> 00:00:11.112
(fast-paced, bouncy violin music)

00:00:20.655 --> 00:00:22.843
- [Narrator] Before the
cowboys of the Wild West,

00:00:22.843 --> 00:00:26.605
there were Hungary's Csikós,
horseman of the Puszta,

00:00:26.605 --> 00:00:29.168
Hungary's Great Plain.

00:00:29.168 --> 00:00:31.141
There way of life is centuries-old

00:00:31.141 --> 00:00:34.662
and blends tradition with
death-defying riding.

00:00:34.662 --> 00:00:38.329
They are some of Europe's
greatest horsemen.

00:00:50.769 --> 00:00:52.300
- [Narrator] The Csikós
are tasked with caring

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:54.127
for the region's horses and cattle

00:00:54.127 --> 00:00:56.710
using centuries-old techniques.

00:01:14.288 --> 00:01:16.455
- [Narrator] Adam's father,
János, has been a Csikós

00:01:16.455 --> 00:01:19.643
for 35 years, the first in the family.

00:01:19.643 --> 00:01:22.976
Adam followed in his father's footsteps.

00:01:29.229 --> 00:01:31.706
- [Narrator] The riders
live in relative isolation

00:01:31.706 --> 00:01:33.835
on ranches that dot the plains.

00:01:33.835 --> 00:01:36.325
Only a few Csikós are left in the region,

00:01:36.325 --> 00:01:37.865
and it's becoming
difficult to keep the ways

00:01:37.865 --> 00:01:39.698
of the horseman alive.

00:01:57.369 --> 00:02:00.702
(lively acoustic music)

00:02:04.730 --> 00:02:06.897
(chiming)

